  "title": "Disclose GenAI On Consumer Request",
  "content": "A supplier using generative AI in a consumer transaction must disclose that fact when the consumer makes a clear and unambiguous request. A safe harbor is available: a clear and conspicuous disclosure at the outset and throughout the interaction eliminates enforcement exposure, regardless of whether a request is made.",
